  "title": "Mediterranean Tuna Bites",
  "description": "A light and delicious combo of tuna, chopped cucumber, and red onions seasoned with a lime and mustard vinaigrette is served on Snack Factory® Pretzel Crisps® and topped with sliced olives and crumbled feta cheese.",
